  "description": "Local Shen, Urgot, and Yone joint review bundle. It keeps the fixed battle scale and compact portraits for Shen, Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir; uses Shen's three-charge spirit-blade Q and native 1.5-second E taunt; keeps Urgot W on the crash-safe single-hit pure-data route and E on the rush-behind flip contract; and rebuilds Yone with guarded Q1/Q2/Q3 progression, one airborne Q3 wind lane, plus an E-spirit and W-crescent composite in the three active slots exposed by Mod API 0.8. Yone W has one non-tower-enemy damage hitbox and a separate champion-only capped shield probe. The public data API cannot restore real hero coordinates, so Yone E is explicitly a visual outbound/BackToCaster return approximation. This local integration build does not merge either Draft PR. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
